<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00514/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一<strong>只</strong>会让文字变得<strong>可爱</strong>的<strong>超赞</strong>的<strong>小精灵❤</strong>！简直<strong>绝赞❤❤❤</strong>！！！<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██<strong>年的美妙的一天</strong><br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong><strong>魅力十足</strong>的<strong>可爱的</strong>Dr.<strong>卡丽尔</strong>的<strong>敲可爱笔记本</strong>里！<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被Dr.<strong>卡丽尔爱着</strong>欧！！！<strong>赞赞赞！</strong><br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>Dr.<strong>卡丽尔</strong>忽然发现，<strong>可爱笔记本</strong>里的文字<strong>爬满了办公室的文章呢！！！真是太赞了！</strong><br />
<strong>另加补充说明：</strong>被<strong>可爱</strong>的字都加粗了呢，看起来<strong>好可爱</strong>！！！</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">点这里的话可以看到没有可爱过的Dr.卡丽尔的话呢！</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>啊啊啊啊我是男的啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！为什么这东西[脏话删除]会出现在我的研究记录上！——Carriere博士</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00514" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00514" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00514-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mr-da" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6069540); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6069540&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609790252" alt="Mr_DA" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6069540)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mr-da" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6069540); return false;">Mr_DA</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1609596968 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">02 Jan 2021 14:16</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00297/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个深蓝色的16K笔记本，厚度约为4.815cm。其封面的右上角有一个<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">月牙形</span> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">上弦月形</span> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">满月形</span> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">下弦月形</span> 表现形式会受10m内的任意被书写于纸上的日期影响的月亮图案。笔记本的内页是纯白色，无任何可辨识字迹。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>位于██街██号的一家破旧文具店<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">置于Site-██的低价值储物室</span> Site-██公共区域的一张靠墙放置的桌子上，作为墙上挂历的辅助工具<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>“我终于知道为什么那个家伙在我做记录时莫名其妙地在旁边狂撕了二十几页日历” ——研究员████<br />
“因为健忘的主管██████似乎没告诉你这个笔记本的完整情况，所以我就想让你更直观的感受一下它的‘独特之处’。本质上我是在帮助你的说” ——研究员██</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00297" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00297" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00297-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ghostwood" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6411077); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6411077&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609790252" alt="GhostWood" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6411077)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ghostwood" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6411077); return false;">GhostWood</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1593847480 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">04 Jul 2020 07:24</span></p>
</div>
